Description: Provides helper functions for importing and processing survey
    data exported from the 'GESIS AppKit' platform
    <https://www.gesis.org/en/gesis-appkit>. Includes support for
    extracting variable and value labels from 'SPSS' syntax files,
    and automatically attaching these labels to raw CSV survey data for
    clean analysis.
